Iceball: controls
=================

Upstream's keys, from clsave/pub/controls.json (change them there, or with
C on the launcher):

  W A S D            move
  Space              jump
  Ctrl               crouch
  V                  sneak
  R                  reload
  1 to 0             choose a tool (spade, block, gun, grenade, ...)
  Cursor keys        choose the colour for blocks
  Mouse              look; the buttons use the tool in hand
  T, Y, U            talk to all, to your team, to your squad
  Page Up/Down       scroll the chat
  M                  map
  , (comma)          team menu
  . (full stop)      weapon menu
  Tab                scores
  Escape             quit

On the launcher: L starts a local game on your own Amiga, a number joins a
server from the list, C changes your settings, Escape leaves.
